 `disableOnStart` are recorded and replayed on the new controls, and calls that targeted a specific list are matched against that list.\n- **The two ways the deferral broke were fixed.** Render activates the Home tab and calls the margins update, and each one forced the full build before LoadDoc. The tab handler now ignores Home, and the margins update now runs as part of the deferred build.\n- **`HeaderFooterTab` buttons keep their ids.** Its buttons in the Insert slots are built at the same moment, through a one-time `controls:deferred` event or right away if the build already happened. Only their order inside its button set changes, and nothing appears to depend on that order.\n- **One untested case.** Locks that `HeaderFooterTab`'s own controller sets before the build reach the late buttons only through the Toolbar's replay. The matching disabled counts make this low risk.\n\n**Records**\n- The Executor log is filled in.\n- The follow-up request is in `.theseus/spawn/` (building the Header & Footer and View panels after LoadDoc), and the friction lines were added.\n\nVERDICT: APPROVE Toolbar time before LoadDoc drops more than its p25–p75 spread on both files (5/5 blocks each), differential identical, and the deferral is safe for early reads and pre-build locks","ttft_ms":5350,"type":"result","duration_ms":39904,"uuid":"c01de7bf-feb3-48cf-a258-a8c99a0ab074","ttft_stream_ms":3943,"time_to_request_ms":230,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":5,"system_prompt":142,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":4,"input_attachments":14,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":7,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":5,"init_frame_send":2,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":1,"request_announcements":10,"query_setup":3,"auto_mode_context_wait":5,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":14,"message_normalization":3,"client_creation":1,"request_build":6},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to